    "summary": "Bearer: a **PENITENT** model.\n\nOnce per battle, as a [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) begins, you can pick a Vow of Atonement from [Desperate For Redemption](vsdata:ability/adepta-sororitas.penitent-host.desperate-for-redemption). On top of any Vow active for your army, the bearer's unit has that Vow active until the next battle round begins. You can pick it even if it was already picked in the battle.",
